WEBVTT

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:10.890
The Gutsy Galaxy Guard now faces the ultimate crisis.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.800
7 Primevals have assumed human form...

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:16.460
...and successfully infiltrated the Orbit Base.

00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:19.430
The GGG agents attempt resistance but are foiled.

00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:25.940
Is the Orbit Base doomed to become a Zonder Metal Plant in space?

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:40.920
No!

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:58.000
This can't be!

00:00:58.150 --> 00:01:00.510
Time for you to join us!

00:01:03.990 --> 00:01:05.150
Gai...

00:01:09.490 --> 00:01:10.320
What's this?

00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:21.500
A green light?

00:01:25.510 --> 00:01:27.270
I won't let you get away with this!

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:28.900
I'm taking you on...

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:31.150
...31 Machine Primevals!

00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:34.270
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:34.270 --> 00:01:37.170
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:43.850
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:48.790
Run, you powerful Robot Brigade!

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:55.020
With your red gaze and your silver chest!

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:59.110
The G-Stone is your bond with the lion

00:01:59.110 --> 00:02:03.810
to save the future of outer space.

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:07.770
It's time to launch!

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:10.950
Destroying the souls of the people...

00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:14.870
Smash the Zonder Metal to pieces!

00:02:16.690 --> 00:02:19.570
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:22.530
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:25.450
}Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:28.200
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:31.710
Pulverizing steel!

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:35.380
Goldion Hammer!

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:42.910
Magic! Drive! Ultimate power! Guts!

00:02:43.110 --> 00:02:48.910
A hero is born! Great God of Iron...

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:51.730
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:55.910
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:59.730
You are hereby ordered to fuse with the Ultimate King of Braves legend!

00:03:02.730 --> 00:03:02.770
Children of the Stars

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:05.510
<i>Children of the Stars</i>

00:03:22.190 --> 00:03:24.720
Return to dust, you cursed robots!

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:35.760
Have you lost your mind?

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:38.030
Shut up!

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:44.040
What unbelievable power!

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:54.260
Jet-Wapper!

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:58.190
TiGao 3! Dou Nu!

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:07.230
Goldymarg! You trying to kill me or what?

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:10.000
You should be thanking me. I eliminated the enemy!

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:13.770
Thanks a lot!

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:24.640
He's got unbelievable G-Stone power!

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:27.450
He's going for mutual annihilation between his power and ours!

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:29.550
And he's ready to die doing it!

00:04:37.300 --> 00:04:38.560
Oh, no!

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:41.530
If we don't fuse with the main unit we won't have sufficient power!

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:42.800
We're retreating for now!

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:44.730
Can't be helped.

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:49.500
Come back here!

00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:53.810
Thank goodness.

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:57.450
Now everyone who was being manipulated can go back to normal.

00:04:59.890 --> 00:05:01.980
But, where did the Primevals go?

00:05:38.530 --> 00:05:39.760
It's Hana and the others!

00:05:45.430 --> 00:05:46.400
Galeon!

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:47.260
Mamoru!

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:51.600
Chief! Galeon and I are going to rescue Hana and the other kids!

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:52.540
What?

00:05:58.610 --> 00:05:59.310
Right.

00:06:02.150 --> 00:06:03.010
Upper left.

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:12.120
No good, no good. They're not even worthy opponents.

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:16.890
With her eyes and their ability to see through anything and...

00:06:17.170 --> 00:06:21.930
...the gravity wave released by my right arm, there's no escape!

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:27.070
Ear and Nails have retreated.

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:30.770
Ribs and Liver are requesting that we join them.

00:06:31.010 --> 00:06:34.710
Hmph! I suppose it can't be helped. We're changing our plans!

00:06:34.850 --> 00:06:35.840
Wait...

00:06:36.650 --> 00:06:41.610
You're not bailing now, are you? This battle still hasn't been decided!

00:06:41.760 --> 00:06:43.820
You're still the same, J.

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:48.660
The same as when we subjected the Red Planet to mechanization...

00:06:52.130 --> 00:06:55.470
Now that you've lost the J-Ark's main computer...

00:06:55.570 --> 00:06:58.660
...do you really think you can stop the mechanization process?

00:06:58.740 --> 00:07:03.910
J-Jewel Warrior, Soldato Number JW02!

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:05.580
I swear I'll stop you!

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:25.700
J-Jewel, lend me your power!

00:07:44.220 --> 00:07:47.310
I swear I'll bring an end to the battle we started that day!

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:51.120
Really? I wonder if you can.

00:07:51.390 --> 00:07:52.830
Right and to the rear.

00:07:55.960 --> 00:07:57.020
You idiot!

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:00.860
It's that girl!

00:08:02.840 --> 00:08:04.670
What's she doing there?

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:09.540
Don't tell me...

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:11.870
There's no way he can evade me!

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:13.640
Will Knife!

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:29.290
I don't have time to fool around with you two!

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:31.360
Move to join the others.

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:33.290
Get back here, you!

00:08:35.670 --> 00:08:36.190
J!

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:38.140
Don't get in my way, Gai!

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:40.030
This is my battle!

00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:41.730
Who do you think you are?

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:44.910
I'll settle things with you eventually.

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:46.410
Until we meet again!

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:47.670
J...

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:50.570
Damn!

00:08:51.620 --> 00:08:53.250
Where are the enemy groups now?

00:08:53.390 --> 00:08:56.360
It's no good. Enemy Group A, Enemy Group B, Enemy Group C...

00:08:56.420 --> 00:08:58.090
...we've lost sight of them all.

00:08:58.160 --> 00:09:01.090
Liger, aren't you done analyzing that Zonder Crystal yet?

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:04.930
Hold your horses! We only just finished crunching all the basic data.

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:07.400
Give me another 30 minutes and I'll burn you a disc!

00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:14.370
Now detecting a slight aberration within the gravitational field.

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:15.970
It's an intruder in the power reactor!

00:09:16.340 --> 00:09:17.210
Is it the Primevals?

00:09:22.720 --> 00:09:24.410
Reverse!

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:28.020
So this is their nerve system, eh?

00:09:28.090 --> 00:09:30.650
What a primitive power reactor!

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:35.390
However, it will be more than sufficient as an energy source.

00:09:35.460 --> 00:09:40.460
For us to turn this entire base into a Zonder Metal Plant, yes.

00:09:40.670 --> 00:09:44.330
We're going to need great amounts of Earthlings to serve as catalysts.

00:09:45.340 --> 00:09:49.640
The Zonders will feed on the energy generated by stress...

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:54.580
...and once the countless Zonder spores inside them have matured...

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:56.750
...they will be released...

00:09:56.820 --> 00:10:02.310
...and attach themselves to all life-forms comprised of similar cells!

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:14.090
All Earth life-forms, including their young, will be turned into Zonders.

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:22.810
Now, then, let us begin, so we may mechanize the Blue Planet, Earth!

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:34.350
G-Energy approaching.

00:10:34.760 --> 00:10:37.050
Fulfill your mission!

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:40.490
Attack the Machine of Destruction!

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:42.720
Wait for me, Galeon!

00:10:46.730 --> 00:10:47.790
You guys!

00:10:48.070 --> 00:10:49.060
Hana!

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:52.000
I'm going to get you out of here now, okay?

00:10:52.070 --> 00:10:53.630
I've been waiting for you.

00:10:56.580 --> 00:11:02.540
You Earthlings are willing to risk your own lives to protect your comrades.

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:06.990
But I didn't sense anything until now!

00:11:07.590 --> 00:11:12.250
I am able to control micro-black holes as I wish.

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:15.050
As long as I hide myself at the bottom of the gravity well...

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:17.890
...I can't be detected by your sensor.

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:23.700
If I absorb you now, and lock you inside a deep darkness...

00:11:23.770 --> 00:11:26.370
...even if you are the Machine of Destruction built by Cain...

00:11:26.440 --> 00:11:29.070
...you won't be able to use that power of yours!

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:35.850
Even if I am a Machine of Destruction...

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:36.910
You're not.

00:11:38.190 --> 00:11:39.850
You're not a Machine of Destruction.

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:43.260
You're the son of Cain, born on the Green Planet.

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:46.320
And the one who was built as...

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:49.420
...a Machine of Destruction by Abel on the Red Planet...

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:50.520
...that's who I am!

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:51.490
Huh!

00:11:54.200 --> 00:11:58.870
The collective impact of the energy of G and J, increasing.

00:11:59.470 --> 00:12:02.500
Absolute Danger Rate, extremely high.

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:05.280
Eliminate them at once!

00:12:08.380 --> 00:12:11.480
This is bad. They're going to use the energy from the Orbit Base reactor...

00:12:11.550 --> 00:12:13.750
...to mass-produce Zonder Metal.

00:12:13.990 --> 00:12:14.920
Then...

00:12:15.190 --> 00:12:19.320
At this rate, the Orbit Base will be turned into a Zonder Metal Plant!

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:24.690
Oh! Jesus!

00:12:41.720 --> 00:12:45.020
The two planets of the Trinary Solar System...

00:12:45.090 --> 00:12:48.320
G and J. The Green Planet and the Red Planet.

00:12:48.390 --> 00:12:52.420
Even after mechanization, you still think that you can continue to resist?

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:54.590
The two planets?

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:57.120
Don't tell me you've forgotten.

00:13:00.740 --> 00:13:04.140
All life-forms, all machines have become one.

00:13:04.210 --> 00:13:06.670
The Green Planet has been mechanized.

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:13.540
But only Latio, who was born the son of Cain...

00:13:13.620 --> 00:13:17.280
...was able to escape Zonderization because of his natural resistance.

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:18.180
Latio?

00:13:18.450 --> 00:13:19.420
That's right.

00:13:19.490 --> 00:13:22.750
And then an anti-mechanization antimatter circuit...

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:25.720
...was built patterned after Latio's powers.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:28.460
The G-Stone!

00:13:33.030 --> 00:13:35.090
Abel of the Red Planet...

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:39.070
...studied the G-Stone, and created the J-Jewel.

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:42.470
And then he built another version of Latio...

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:45.310
...with advanced psychokinetic powers...

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:48.210
...the Living Weapon, Arma!

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:52.580
Abel also created the Soldato Battalion of cyborg-warriors...

00:13:52.650 --> 00:13:58.350
...which he used with the J-Ark spaceships as his last arsenal against us.

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:03.560
But he was unable to stop the mechanization process.

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:06.230
Arma, built by Abel...

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:08.670
Latio, the son of Cain...

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:13.130
You two are the only survivors, and by getting rid of you...

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:17.580
...I can also eliminate any remaining energy that threatens us.

00:14:17.850 --> 00:14:19.040
But I'm...

00:14:19.780 --> 00:14:21.010
But I'm...

00:14:21.780 --> 00:14:23.510
Waha!

00:14:24.620 --> 00:14:28.420
My father is Isamu Amami! My mother is Ai Amami!

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:34.760
Your memory has been sealed.

00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:37.090
And I'm...

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:38.390
I'm...

00:14:38.530 --> 00:14:39.520
I'm...

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:47.010
Big Brother Gai!

00:14:47.540 --> 00:14:49.640
The time is drawing near...

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:57.180
I'm Mamoru Amami, and I'm from Earth!

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:00.020
You shall be eliminated! Black Hole!

00:15:06.430 --> 00:15:07.550
Don't worry!

00:15:11.730 --> 00:15:13.100
Go rescue the others now!

00:15:14.670 --> 00:15:16.430
Okay! I'll do it!

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:18.290
Arma...

00:15:18.370 --> 00:15:22.900
I see your time on the Blue Planet has given you a sense of camaraderie.

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:25.600
You're wrong. I'm a Machine of Destruction.

00:15:25.680 --> 00:15:28.240
My goal is to annihilate you and your comrades!

00:15:28.380 --> 00:15:31.750
Oh? I wonder if you can still annihilate me now?

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:37.020
It's been a long time...

00:15:37.460 --> 00:15:38.220
Ikumi...

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:40.660
Mother...

00:15:51.570 --> 00:15:55.340
Now then, the Zonder Metal Plant is complete.

00:16:07.260 --> 00:16:12.020
Now everybody on this base will become a Zonder!

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:15.690
Directly above, an enemy!

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:18.430
Yay!

00:16:21.140 --> 00:16:23.470
System Change!

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:34.000
Mic Sounders the 13th!

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:36.980
C'mon, rock 'n' roll!

00:16:38.320 --> 00:16:40.510
Disc X, set on!

00:16:45.130 --> 00:16:47.620
Razzle-Dazzle Double V!

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:48.420
Yeah!

00:16:55.400 --> 00:16:57.430
Is that the Solitary Wave?

00:16:57.710 --> 00:16:58.570
Not bad!

00:16:59.640 --> 00:17:01.730
Orbit Base, separating!

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:05.070
Izanagi, release!

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:11.310
Go get 'em!

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:19.280
Izanagi has made contact with the power reactor!

00:17:19.530 --> 00:17:21.190
Power reactor, emergency shutdown!

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:23.500
We're counting on you, Brave Warriors!

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:24.720
What's this?

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:30.060
The GGG Mobile Unit is here!

00:17:32.170 --> 00:17:33.800
I don't believe this!

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:35.900
Is this the Earthling's battle strategy?

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:39.080
Who would've thought they would destroy the base with their own hands?

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:40.440
Do you really want to self-destruct?

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:43.380
Except we're going to destroy you first!

00:17:45.550 --> 00:17:46.780
You make me laugh!

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:48.980
Let's see you try to destroy us, then!

00:17:49.260 --> 00:17:49.990
Come on!

00:17:49.990 --> 00:17:50.890
Come on! Right!

00:17:55.930 --> 00:17:56.900
Ikumi...

00:17:57.230 --> 00:18:00.790
I never thought the Primeval would fuse with Mother.

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:02.630
I missed you so much...

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:04.160
Ikumi...

00:18:04.370 --> 00:18:06.500
Drop that ridiculous act!

00:18:06.840 --> 00:18:10.640
I know Mother's soul was lost the instant you fused with her.

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:15.150
That's not true. It's me, your mother! I'm myself again now!

00:18:22.760 --> 00:18:23.720
No!

00:18:25.960 --> 00:18:27.660
That's the weakness of a human!

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:32.120
It was this same cell-destroying plasma that shattered...

00:18:32.200 --> 00:18:34.570
...the Red Planet's Living Weapons to pieces!

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:37.440
And you're the last one, Arma!

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:43.800
This J-Power level...

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:50.040
Absorb it all!

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:54.990
The Absolute Protective Wall of the J-Jewel?

00:18:55.720 --> 00:18:58.490
But with that up, you won't be able to move an inch!

00:18:58.560 --> 00:19:01.290
And as for you, if you lose focus at all...

00:19:01.360 --> 00:19:04.390
...you'll be swallowed up by your own black hole!

00:19:04.670 --> 00:19:06.360
Why don't we see who can hold out longer?

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:12.270
Thank goodness! Everyone's alive!

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:15.570
But the air is so thin in here. It's too dangerous for them!

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:18.670
Kaidou! I'm rescuing everybody now!

00:19:21.380 --> 00:19:22.010
Kaidou!

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:23.310
Go on ahead.

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:25.450
Huh? But...

00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:27.950
There must be something I can do to help.

00:19:28.290 --> 00:19:30.450
I'll be all right. Just get out of here.

00:19:30.860 --> 00:19:32.850
This is my battle to fight.

00:19:33.160 --> 00:19:34.250
Kaidou...

00:19:36.060 --> 00:19:39.290
All right. I'm going on ahead with the others.

00:19:40.230 --> 00:19:42.700
But if it gets too tough for you, call me anytime!

00:19:42.940 --> 00:19:45.870
As your friend on Earth!

00:19:46.610 --> 00:19:47.600
All right.

00:19:48.440 --> 00:19:49.410
Thanks!

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:08.130
Mamoru...

00:20:10.200 --> 00:20:12.220
Now detaching the main power reactor!

00:20:21.840 --> 00:20:23.070
Rei!

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:25.210
What a useless attack!

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:27.240
Feng Dao Dan!

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:31.380
No use, no use!

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:38.420
You've managed to survive, thanks to the Gravity Generation Device.

00:20:38.490 --> 00:20:41.760
But how long do you think you can hold on in this vacuum?

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:48.190
You'll be running out of air in this area soon.

00:20:48.370 --> 00:20:51.860
Or would you rather wait to be turned into meteors?

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:57.110
I'll turn you all into space dust!

00:20:58.080 --> 00:20:59.880
Sorry to keep you waiting, people!

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:02.810
Disc X, Exclusive Primeval Version...

00:21:02.880 --> 00:21:03.710
Let's go!

00:21:08.060 --> 00:21:09.020
Yeah!

00:21:09.090 --> 00:21:10.720
No problem, guys!

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:12.820
C'mon, rock 'n' roll!

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:16.820
Disc X Remix Version, set on!

00:21:19.430 --> 00:21:20.400
Yeah!

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:26.300
What's this?

00:21:26.370 --> 00:21:30.370
Solitary Wave, emanating from directly above!

00:21:37.050 --> 00:21:40.080
We've got to fuse with the Main Unit or we won't have sufficient power!

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:48.320
So Disc X worked on them!

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:50.930
Now that the Primevals are just particles, where are they headed?

00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:53.800
They've split up in 6 directions and started fusing with their ships!

00:21:58.940 --> 00:22:00.630
They're going to launch a counter-attack!

00:22:05.910 --> 00:22:09.010
The enemy ship has started to move. It's headed in this direction!

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:11.840
Bring Izanagi back right now!

00:22:15.190 --> 00:22:16.780
Is Arma inside the enemy ship?

00:22:17.090 --> 00:22:19.690
We can't afford to lose Arma right now.

00:22:20.630 --> 00:22:23.260
All right! Launch the J-Ark!

00:22:23.660 --> 00:22:24.630
Roger!

00:22:27.400 --> 00:22:29.890
Command, Communication and Control Ship, Susanoh!

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:32.500
High-Mobility Twin-Hull Supply and Maintenance Ship, Amaterasu!

00:22:32.570 --> 00:22:33.670
Rapid launch!

00:22:34.310 --> 00:22:35.800
We're going on the attack.

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:37.700
It will be ship to ship combat!

00:22:46.470 --> 00:22:50.370
Even if there are more than a million stars between us...

00:22:51.570 --> 00:22:55.240
...I know I can get there without losing my way.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:01.420
Because I can see the road that leads to you.

00:23:01.420 --> 00:23:06.210
It's sparkling ahead of me.

00:23:06.840 --> 00:23:10.380
The journey I began that day...

00:23:11.550 --> 00:23:17.310
...will surely make our bond even stronger.

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:24.070
The wings that send me into the galaxy...

00:23:24.070 --> 00:23:28.730
...let's believe in them now.

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:34.070
When you and I are grown up

00:23:34.070 --> 00:23:41.070
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.050 --> 00:23:48.010
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.420 --> 00:23:51.610
Annihilate the 7 Ultimate Machine Primevals!

00:23:51.950 --> 00:23:54.080
Promise us you'll win this showdown on the moon!

00:23:54.620 --> 00:23:57.150
For the GGG Brave Hero Space Fleet...

00:23:57.220 --> 00:24:00.160
For the J-Ark, and for Mamoru and Kaidou...

00:24:00.390 --> 00:24:03.120
The time has come to join all forces!

00:24:03.430 --> 00:24:05.360
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:05.430 --> 00:24:06.760
"A Distant Victory Song"

00:24:06.210 --> 00:24:06.250
A Distant Victory Song

00:24:06.830 --> 00:24:09.930
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:11.910 --> 00:24:14.830
Gatling Driver

00:24:12.770 --> 00:24:14.410
This is the Key to Victory!
